></span><i><em style="width:48%"></em></i></div></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><p class="kicker">PERSONNEL</p><h3>Military strength</h3></div><span>Details →</span></div><div class="stat-list"><div><span>Attack units</span><strong>850</strong></div><div><span>Defense units</span><strong>1,200</strong></div><div><span>Covert agents</span><strong>160</strong></div><div><span>Anti-intelligence</span><strong>140</strong></div></div></div></div><div class="panel table-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><p class="kicker">NEXT ACTIONS</p><h3>Strategic checklist</h3></div></div><div class="action-row"><div><span class="action-number">01</span><div><strong>Train your population</strong><small>Choose miners, troops, spies, or defense personnel.</small></div></div><span class="text-button">Open training →</span></div><div class="action-row"><div><span class="action-number">02</span><div><strong>Review intelligence</strong><small>Recon nearby realms before committing attack turns.</small></div></div><span class="text-button">Review reports →</span></div></div></section></main></div><script>
document.querySelectorAll('.nav-group > .nav-link').forEach(function(link){
  link.addEventListener('click', function(event){
    event.preventDefault();
    var group = link.closest('.nav-group');
    document.querySelectorAll('.nav-group').forEach(function(item){ if(item !== group) item.classList.remove('open'); });
    group.classList.toggle('open');
  });
});
document.querySelectorAll('.sub-link').forEach(function(link){
  link.addEventListener('click', function(event){
    event.preventDefault();
    document.querySelectorAll('.sub-link').forEach(function(item){ item.classList.remove('active'); });
    link.classList.add('active');
    document.querySelector('.topbar h1').textContent = link.textContent;
    document.querySelector('.eyebrow').textContent = 'UNIVERSE CIVILIZATION: EMPIRE AT WARS / ' + link.closest('.nav-group').querySelector('.nav-link span:nth-child(2)').textContent.toUpperCase();
  });
});
</script></body></html>
